    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b687907a0dd58b6e6aaf8745",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这位赛马娘叫做里见光钻。\n她和北部玄驹从小就玩在一起，\n也是知名大企业“里见”集团的千金。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c59bd34178112408acbe09fbcde5bc07df8289fad8b76fe49bdd08d86a13bb78",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1068/storytimeline_501068100.json",
